# The menu cursor on the pad: while UWindow shows its cursor the left stick moves it (linear from the dead zone's
# edge, a viewport height a second at full tilt) and the keys bound to Fire and AltFire click left and right; the
# mouse's own motion takes it back. Positions are for a 640x480 viewport at GUIScale 1 with DefUser.ini's layout
# (Fire on the right trigger and shoulder); start a map, e.g. 'DM-Deck16][?Game=Botpack.DeathMatchPlus'. The
# Controls page step binds Joy13 in the run tree's User.ini; the last line puts Fire back on it.
waitlog up for play
sleep 3
pad attach
sleep 1
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe menu
mouse 0 240
sleep 0.3
probe mouse-at-left
pad axis leftx 32767
sleep 0.2
watch 40 cursor-full
sleep 0.6
pad axis leftx 0
sleep 0.2
probe after-full
pad axis leftx -16384
sleep 0.2
watch 40 cursor-half
sleep 0.6
pad axis leftx 0
sleep 0.2
pad axis leftx 3000
sleep 0.5
probe inside-dead-zone
pad axis leftx 0
mouse 320 300
sleep 0.3
probe mouse-took-over
# AltFire (the left trigger) right-clicks once the stick has the cursor.
pad axis lefty 6000
sleep 0.05
pad axis lefty 0
pad axis lefttrigger 32767
sleep 0.1
pad axis lefttrigger 0
sleep 0.3
# Fire (the right trigger) clicks Options on the menu bar; the stick puts the cursor on its first item
# (Preferences) and Start (Enter) runs it.
mouse 100 5
sleep 0.1
pad axis leftx 6000
sleep 0.05
pad axis leftx 0
pad axis righttrigger 32767
sleep 0.1
pad axis righttrigger 0
sleep 0.3
probe options-menu
pad axis lefty 32767
sleep 0.04
pad axis lefty 0
sleep 0.3
probe on-preferences
pad button start 1
pad button start 0
sleep 1
probe start-ran-it
# The Controls page: Fire clicks a binding, which then waits for a key; the right trigger is bound as itself.
mouse 320 58
sleep 0.1
pad axis leftx 6000
sleep 0.05
pad axis leftx 0
pad axis righttrigger 32767
sleep 0.1
pad axis righttrigger 0
sleep 0.3
mouse 340 200
sleep 0.1
pad axis leftx 6000
sleep 0.05
pad axis leftx 0
pad axis righttrigger 32767
sleep 0.1
pad axis righttrigger 0
sleep 0.3
probe binding-waits
pad axis righttrigger 32767
sleep 0.1
pad axis righttrigger 0
sleep 0.3
log keybinding Joy13 follows
exec keybinding Joy13
sleep 0.3
# The binding is made, and the right trigger is no longer Fire; the right shoulder (Fire) clicks the binding again.
pad button rightshoulder 1
sleep 0.1
pad button rightshoulder 0
sleep 0.3
probe waits-again
# A binding left waiting when Back closes its window takes nothing: the right shoulder clicks.
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 0.5
probe window-closed
mouse 320 300
sleep 0.1
pad axis leftx 6000
sleep 0.05
pad axis leftx 0
pad button rightshoulder 1
sleep 0.1
pad button rightshoulder 0
sleep 0.3
# Back closes the menus; in play the left stick walks and the right shoulder is Joy11 again.
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe play
pad axis leftx 32767
sleep 0.5
probe walking
pad axis leftx 0
pad button rightshoulder 1
sleep 0.1
pad button rightshoulder 0
sleep 0.3
exec set input Joy13 Fire
sleep 0.3
